Run quota sync with minimal output.
1) exec: curl -sf http://localhost:20128/v1/models > /dev/null
2) if success, write workspace/tmp/provider-quota.json with compact JSON:
{"updated":"<ISO timestamp>","9router_running":true,"providers":{"claude-code":{"available":"unknown"},"cursor":{"available":"unknown"},"gemini":{"available":"unknown"},"codex":{"available":"unknown"},"iflow":{"available":"unknown"},"qwen":{"available":"unknown"}},"note":"auto-refresh via ENG recovery job"}
3) if fail, write compact JSON: {"updated":"<ISO timestamp>","9router_running":false,"note":"9router down"}
4) Return NO_REPLY only.
